@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api

### Refresh a single repository on demand
POST {{baseUrl}}/repositories/platform-core/refresh

### Export the dependency graph as Mermaid
GET {{baseUrl}}/dependencies/graph

### Trigger the weekly sweep manually (timer functions are invoked through the admin endpoint)
POST http://localhost:7071/admin/functions/WeeklyInventorySweepFunction
Content-Type: application/json

{}
